+accuracy on that same subset (A3|D = 63.6% and 60.6% respectively,
+Table tab:verifier_comparison).
+The cascade's positive delta over FFT-only in this regime (Table tab:crossdataset)
+reflects the semantic detector's quality gap over the artifact detector, not a
+genuine contribution from VLM escalation; the value proposition of escalation
+holds only under Case 3 (Section VI).

